WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.750
Welcome to Maturity and practice group levels. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Understand the distinction between organizational maturity ratings and progressive practice groups..

2
00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:23.080
Consider this scenario. Three teams share a written procedure, but one never follows it. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:32.590
Start with two steps: Recognize initial performance. Then Identify managed work. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:43.940
Continue with Evaluate organizational standardization. Then Examine quantitative control and optimization. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:55.200
Stronger evidence looks like this: Evidence of actual implementation. Weaker evidence would be: An unverified claim. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:09.450
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
